","id":"CONTROL-RELEASE-ATOMICITY-1","severity":"must","obligation":"plan","root":"方案只要求Host终局回写及最终重读检查同一事实集合，没有定义释放资格如何与并发发送/受理写者线性化。当前Host从RunStore读一次终态后逐操作MarkOperationTerminal，最后仅重读受理存储；单加一次最终RunStore重读仍可能在已经错误释放后才发现事实变化。Paused停止只检查旧CurrentSubmission.InFlight；Cancelled重试直接进入终局回写；异常收敛跳过所有终态。方案也没有精确定义前置Intent/Submitted/Unknown、主体Rejected但SendAttempted、收尾pending/dispatching/submitted等组合的清偿表。"},{"key":"5b6d4adb2ee7017edbdaca0d2c14a7dbca55bb98b62fba58bdbf9f2bfb9a32b9","id":"G4a-residual","severity":"important","obligation":"implementation","root":"real entry/machine evidence for startup handoff missing"},{"key":"5c87c26e801236c8f5dff1c6f22f8af9c391ef211907076a36c6638599c2196a","id":"R5-IMPORTANT-7","severity":"important","obligation":"implementation","root":"已认证正常 prepared 路径的映射仍不能证明能力降级、幂等早返回和 nojournal 成功资格；历史标签、关键反例与当前证明必须继续逐项对齐。"},{"key":"61e922a03c8eadf3ee75d355f329081be9794449bd29cad9f16ea76f6746ead7","id":"CONTROL-RUN-LIFECYCLE-1","severity":"must","obligation":"plan","root":"首审要求耐久Stop、不可变运行基线、无驱动恢复及自动触发所属生命周期。v2 §1/3/4/5已定义StopAuthority与单调StopRequested、原受理落盘、恢复/重放不重新基准化、FireSteps继承挂载来源、现有撤销入口和实际面板对账。新增同机单调意图时间与最近ManualStop标记处理未Ready期间延迟捕获基线，仍保持版本单一权威。只关闭方案义务，不关闭尚未实现的行为。"},{"key":"653c8ca3d50e9ba5e4ea9e83553ed3a9892ad0b87f8c87905256d0c89d139134","id":"IMPLEMENTATION-NOJOURNAL-PUBLICATION-FRESH-1","severity":"important","obligation":"implementation","root":"PublishPreparedMain 在调用发布前 stageHook 后，只在有 journal 分支重新 RefreshControlledWitness。无 journal 分支直接序列化 requested 与之前取得的 ControlledLatest。因此完整基线已建立的 SnapshotReady、无数据操作的 RolledBack，以及对应无 journal 终态重开，可以把回调前见证作为回调后成功发布的资格。此处尚未形成与有 journal 分支相同的成功资格协议。"},{"key":"68691610984aa09144b51106bd67d2daaecf6b8545fa4c073dfab0ba5ad39f2d","id":"R5-IMPORTANT-3","severity":"important","obligation":"implementation","root":"InvokeExternal 会设置回调标志，但公开 mutation 的回调重入检查仍在 lock(_sync) 内。Dispose 已有锁前请求登记，其他入口没有实现 V3-PROTOCOL-CANDIDATE 要求的锁前原子拒绝。"},{"key":"6986205d57cccfe5a6ba819a0697e18dc72482e761f91150c906273cdb7a09a7","id":"IMPLEMENTATION-FORWARD-RECOVERY-1","severity":"important","obligation":"implementation","root":"逐项 Applied 已进入 journal，但主 manifest 的 ReferenceWriteSet 仍在整批成功后才发布。CompleteRollback 的 Added 预检只查主 manifest 的 AcceptedVersions，尚未从有效 Applied 前缀派生归属。"},{"key":"6ac4500b4ad4fa9b8f7f0a0e97cf8276fa7b6501a866ddfc5caecbb6124291d4","id":"CONTROL-RUN-LIFECYCLE-1","severity":"must","obligation":"plan","root":"方案要求持久停止意图、旧运行不能复活、停止触发器，却没有给出运行字段、受理提交点、既有记录兼容规则和自动触发来源的基线继承步骤。Runner 当前 Stop 仅取消进程内RunCts；等待只做一次长Delay；Paused/LocalWaitParking可能没有驱动。启动中心定时、电子狗和日志挂载可在以后通过FireSteps发起新的移交，若每次自动发起都读取当前版本作为新run基线，仍能把F11前挂载意图洗成新版本。Unknown目前也没有实际对账动作入口，Completing和LocalWaitParking的UI停止能力不完整。"},{"key":"72226bc4b46d8c7c2fb03035cf954ebbf5874b8932b868fd9ac59ce6c153fc0b","id":"PLAN-NATIVE-BUNDLE-COMPATIBILITY-1","severity":"important","obligation":"plan","root":"方案要求修改native_review.py并更新review-bundle.json，同时保留原产品和突变收据且不重跑。review_support.verify_bundle验证bundle文件后返回整个bundle文档的摘要；native_review.py在该集合中。execution_evidence.validate要求每份receipt.bundle等于这个当前摘要，因此bundle更新使原收据先于TRX/JSON分派被拒绝。方案未说明同层认证兼容路径。"},{"key":"750eeaa134f9b6972b970355b40fe429de6acabccf29571c895adc7c3e9a561f","id":"IMPLEMENTATION-ATOMIC-VIEW-1","severity":"must","obligation":"implementation","root":"现代 main 发布和回滚仍按当前端口类型选择实现。持久现代历史以能力不足实例重开，可进入普通 File.Move 发布及旧 CompleteRollback，绕过 RootAuthority、完整 main 输入 CAS 和同事务派生关系。"},{"key":"7723d9c9bb876144505b25029f9ef39f7f458382361f68b8d091a4cdb87a197b","id":"PLAN-EVIDENCE-PROJECTION-SNAPSHOT-1","severity":"important","obligation":"plan","root":"v7 已修复候选矩阵、逐风险映射及历史保全来源缺失，但候选所有 covered 行仍引用 current-v13-full，而其实际当前 TRX、认证 receipt 和执行日志不在本冻结合同中。映射包含 80 个具名 testId，其中只有 15 个可以在本次冻结的当前 PFP baseline/restored TRX 中确认绿色结果；其余 65 个仅能读到历史 TRX 或 current_test_results 摘要。另有 66 个 PFP receipt 引用的 recipe 和 CP1 三份 controlled-writer-evidence.json 未冻结。因此不能把可读摘要和局部 PFP 原件视为全部当前映射的执行来源。"},{"key":"7e488589a548f285cf148b69d105a5d9bd5f3c651e9cecf2b4cde54ed2be774a","id":"IMPLEMENTATION-IDEMPOTENT-WHOLE-ROOT-1","severity":"important","obligation":"implementation","root":"现代 IPreparedMigrationEffectService 主事务存在绕过当前完整根资格的成功早返回。ApplyReferenceUpdate 在 ReferenceUpdating 调用 RecheckReferenceWriteSet；该函数只比较写集内容哈希。ActivateCandidate 在 Activated 调用 RecheckActivationRecord；该函数只比较激活目标内容哈希与状态。Rollback 在 RolledBack 直接成功。LoadForMutation/AdmitOrCheckMain 认证主 manifest 输入及 journal 派生关系，不认证当前配置根的成员、全部文件/目录身份和 Applied 链对应状态。因此这些入口没有兑现仍有效的“下一入口必须 fresh 发现并保留”合同。RecoverOnStart 的终态修复不能覆盖调用这些其他公开入口的分支。"},{"key":"7e63452ff782303ddbbc6c946b3cfc8f22eeea03d95b565da5acc2e6b131a972","id":"R5-IMPORTANT-3","severity":"important","obligation":"implementation","root":"显式 stageHook、端口、quiesce 和 utcNow 已受回调 guard 保护，但 RecordChanges 在持有 monitor 并取得局部 manifest 后直接消费调用方 IEnumerable；GetEnumerator/MoveNext 的调用方代码不在 guard 内。重入可以改变持久登记，再被外层旧局部状态覆盖；无流 worker 等待也可以进入未标记回调的 monitor 死锁路径。"},{"key":"7f44a6278ed736456a39248ea927648f3574b82f2cba209a8a66e1ee3af016a9","id":"interleaving-5","severity":"important","obligation":"implementation","root":">32 node E2E pending (P50/P19(1))"},{"key":"7fc450fb0b2cd4e9abe5f487fcc0403c53af69bbb48e9afabb41f4aa80f68de8","id":"R5-MUST-2","severity":"must","obligation":"implementation","root":"第六轮原文：预测前的写集哈希检查与预测端口实际读盘没有绑定；端口没有校验事务提供的预期输入版本，故未经确认内容可能成为 RevertedHash 并让回滚覆盖他方数据。当前 expectedInputHash 为候选修复，尚未按新流程独立闭环。"},{"key":"84637bd1c030bcf32e3c8cd51bcc8863d2920780349d8a92209962060afe6ee9","id":"R1-MUST-1","severity":"must","obligation":"implementation","root":"激活输入版本与确认写集的绑定曾不完整；后续静态修复结论不是执行闭环。"},{"key":"85f5e15229d10ff9bf90d963a6fefd5bdce67205b055333525d270c7edef31d0","id":"PLAN-COMPATIBILITY-1","severity":"important","obligation":"plan","root":"旧格式识别规则“唯一匹配一个已知格式，歧义拒绝”把算法标签唯一性当成合法记录唯一性。冻结 diff 证明 pre-revertedHash 与当前算法仅在非空 ActivationRecord 分支的摘要材料不同；无激活记录时两者摘要完全相同。"},{"key":"8b2961468dbd68328de408d5a506996c763a7f3bbaad3a5d5546f83f8fccb1f9","id":"interleaving-6","severity":"important","obligation":"implementation","root":"four-entry coverage real entry evidence missing"},{"key":"8f993661edbe7db6bb601c563a622ddd77c5309a02740c16042a29870dd648fa","id":"IMPLEMENTATION-MODERN-MAIN-CAS-1","severity":"must","obligation":"implementation","root":"PublishPreparedMain captures expectedMainSha before stageHook, but its journal branch does not pass that expectation to BuildMainCompanion. The latter rereads raw main after the hook and uses that hash as CAS input. ValidateMainAgainstAuthority checks derived fields, so a valid foreign CreatedAtUtc change is accepted as overwrite input. MigrationArtifactWrite has only ExpectedSha256, not file identity, and MarkBlocked can reread foreign main and adopt it again."},{"key":"906ce604bcbe7dfc39af9e2da502cd5bc8a9c13448bb9c5893cd7fb8177f221d","id":"IMPLEMENTATION-ATOMIC-VIEW-1","severity":"must","obligation":"implementation","root":"实际数据与 Applied receipt/journal 已配对提交，但主 manifest 的激活记录、派生写集和成功阶段仍由后续普通 File.Move 发布。恢复逻辑仍部分依赖这个滞后视图；prepared 实例在 journal 缺失时还存在普通 IO 回退。当前 journal 校验也没有实现原完整阶段表的全部关系。"},{"key":"91c83c22ff597aaf028ff6e171dfe649f601989c380fd9164afce04d875834d8","id":"G2(e)","severity":"important","obligation":"implementation","root":"real double-copy + Rejected E2E fixture missing"},{"key":"9215e504a9d889466d15e385cb59d62d41b323b3c9e0494b83bc816d27271f3a","id":"FACILITY-NATIVE-MIXED-RESULTS-1","severity":"important","obligation":"implementation","root":"冻结 native_review.implementation_proofs 仍对每个认证 results 无条件调用 parse_trx，合法 writer JSON 会导致 XML ParseError。V12 的精确 manifest.tests 路径分派方案可行，但尚未取得完整可执行方案许可、实施或当前认证。"},{"key":"96534b1955e92da7fa9a010e8406c9b9dfeadf013debcac01ac1020fde179533","id":"IMPLEMENTATION-PROOF-RELEVANCE-1","severity":"important","obligation":"implementation","root":"Valid current PFP records do not prove every original fault root. CP6 removes callback rejection only, CP7 removes disposed-entry rejection only, and CP10 removes BaselineObservation only when latest is not Restore. These cannot establish original exception containment, mid-operation release deferral or resume after actual Restore has produced B."},{"key":"9837ec443d7e2b52f3767810a06b4bf8b1d5041cf9afa55c996f617d11c3e3dc","id":"G10-residual","severity":"important","obligation":"implementation","root":"structured ledger fields do not carry original reason"},{"key":"9a1a83113e020f2e84021711ae9d58b1796e7b3a10f5644c1c91af9d151774d3","id":"PLAN-NATIVE-BUNDLE-COMPATIBILITY-1","severity":"important","obligation":"plan","root":"V12 已纠正固定 15 个 bundle 成员、测试输入认证、原 22 sources 和隔离副本执行等问题，但遗漏原已批准 source extension 的当前许可身份承接。opening.sources 为 8 项，manifest.sources 为 22 项，native_scope_extension 的 14 个 paths 正好覆盖差集，却仍绑定旧 plan_request=7eb064d91dab44c99cc5da2e41f97844。validate_scope_extension 强制它绑定当前 latest plan request 和该请求的实际 receipt SHA；新的方案许可产生后，现有 extension 会失效。"},{"key":"9fc10f50bd9f4eca55a906f38859f1b52fabf7e5b8672867b94a3103bc7cffef","id":"PLAN-VERSION-CHAIN-1","severity":"must","obligation":"plan","root":"v2 已补输出身份、墓碑、部分前缀及阶段表，但缺少未应用 Prepared 的合法终结协议。State 只有 Prepared/Applied；Applied 必须连续前缀、Prepared 只能是末项；RolledBack 禁止未完成 Prepared，Blocked 又禁止正向操作。方案没有取消、NotApplied 或将末项移交不可变历史的转换。"},{"key":"a1d6f3b32f7c77e1b7330a3ada3ce25db0c33a0d76227b78edcebbee83da6ff1","id":"R1-MUST-2","severity":"must","obligation":"implementation","root":"写入意图、实际创建归属和删除授权曾混为一谈；当前候选保护缺少最终认证。"},{"key":"a66ac212e2a4049efdd04cea61a76db2c27b053233cf10a3b3ec7b1e889ceec5","id":"R5-IMPORTANT-5","severity":"important","obligation":"implementation","root":"撤销证据的有效阶段曾未限定，破坏原有哈希关系。"},{"key":"a6d4cb2a7592c945a27f85bf7c0add89756f7e228199e8d2faaff8e75ece8f38","id":"IMPLEMENTATION-NOJOURNAL-PUBLICATION-FRESH-1","severity":"important","obligation":"implementation","root":"PublishPreparedMain只在有journal分支于prehook后重新取得资格。无journal分支直接发布此前ControlledLatest，允许成功发布前漂移被旧见证覆盖。"},{"key":"aa6a3d5d90f383d4a5936d06cf2ee39001ade34af96f076ef2c7b04d6925ae73","id":"IMPLEMENTATION-FORWARD-RECOVERY-1","severity":"important","obligation":"implementation","root":"正向副作用先发生，足以恢复的逐文件归属及激活意图只在整批成功读回后保存。"},{"key":"aac835db1fffa29e1b7db3bc3ffc9098fb810025775831befb129078e238460a","id":"R5-IMPORTANT-3","severity":"important","obligation":"implementation","root":"调用方IEnumerable的GetEnumerator/MoveNext在持有monitor并取得局部manifest后被直接消费，未进入callback guard或不可变输入冻结。"},{"key":"ac5d492f1a9c9c04c963a85d629c1be1dd098f62cd99467577774e3dfe434fe7","id":"IMPLEMENTATION-MANIFEST-COMPATIBILITY-1","severity":"important","obligation":"implementation","root":"持久化完整性格式发生变化，但运行manifest版本和旧格式验证没有对应变化。"},{"key":"adc447becb60b069ab15f8605a68cc515ca444ca1bb0eb4b0bc1afc3addc251d","id":"CONTROL-CONFIRMATION-EXIT-1","severity":"must","obligation":"plan","root":"方案将明确业务终态作为停止清偿条件，但当前 job.status 可在执行真正退出前公布终态。TaskRunner 在释放物理槽前登记终态；一条龙在 rootLifetime Dispose 前登记父终态；前置/收尾在 semaphore finally 和 scope Dispose 前登记结果。InstanceRequestHandler 已正确 await dispatch.Task.Unwrap 后才返回 Executor，应该复用该真实等待，不重写它。方案还没有定义如何把这个退出事实连同 epoch 和完整作业身份带到停止确认；现有 QueryJobStatusAsync 丢弃响应中的 bgiEpoch，AwaitTerminalAsync 只接收 jobId。前置取消确认在取消发送失败时直接返回 Unknown，且只接受 cancelled，不能完整保存停止与正常完成竞态。"},{"key":"af17baf64df0d39e61d9d253267c86963aa871a43a59f544d91d3988dcad6678","id":"IMPLEMENTATION-PRODUCTION-GATE-1","severity":"must","obligation":"implementation","root":"当前生产拒绝依赖本实例 prepared 端口，合法现代隔离历史换 null/nonprepared 实例后仍可授权 Action。"},{"key":"b3625a1bae538ddbf4aea65873d4634e15204627371a6e193d791bca83ee2582","id":"R5-MUST-1","severity":"must","obligation":"implementation","root":"副作用与持久化归属证据的顺序及中间态关系不一致。"},{"key":"b3cbc4cd3431c9dee1bc7aff98466a7e00c6b86610178aa292f44bbf3bd1fe73","id":"R5-IMPORTANT-3","severity":"important","obligation":"implementation","root":"外部回调范围大于守卫范围，嵌套操作可污染外层局部状态。"},{"key":"b4ba4515c4ee9b972bee106f57bd5da7f992f7db5593efa0a5a0827c89c803a1","id":"CONTROL-RELEASE-ATOMICITY-1","severity":"must","obligation":"plan","root":"首审指出Host只读旧State后回写、最终重读不能撤销先误释放。v2已规定RunStore同门序列化准备/停止/终局封闭，耐久terminal-release封印绑定身份、修订、基线及清偿摘要；封印后禁止新增外部事实，Host锁外消费稳定封印并逐映射重试。清偿表缺少确定拒绝路径仍由CONTROL-CONFIRMATION-EXIT-1阻断，不代表该缺口已经解决。"},{"key":"b5e5037b99fd038bcdac210f99434295101c935202f16572a5d2e6f0ae9224d5","id":"PLAN-ROOT-CONSISTENCY-1","severity":"important","obligation":"plan","root":"VSS 同点见证＋每边 TxF CAS 的路线可以满足原合同允许的等效一致性方向，但两个实际连接仍未定义：full-root 清单包含空目录，journal 却只有文件操作；存续 Global mutex 租约跨公开调用持有，却未规定线程所有者及跨线程 Dispose/释放协议。"},{"key":"b9938bbed3f393c61fa5365af69bef4d8cb031d54f8ac53c05ced52857da042b","id":"IMPLEMENTATION-WRITER-REPARSE-1","severity":"must","obligation":"implementation","root":"原实际TxF writer跟随替换后的链接；同一已登记对象移到根外后仍保留FileId、字节和长度，完整Matches不足以证明实际写入对象仍属于允许路径。当前实际data/main/directory句柄采用OPEN_REPARSE_POINT，在写删前从同一实际句柄拒绝reparse/EFS/多链接/种类错误，并验证normalized final name等于预期路径且位于预期根。现有parent同样不follow；artifact新parent逐段在同一事务内创建并验证。"},{"key":"bb9345b8145284cadce1061808400a40f36a57b958479ebe964fd0857a0d981e","id":"PLAN-CURRENT-PARENT-PERMIT-PROVENANCE-1","severity":"important","obligation":"plan","root":"当前config保留原extra清单并新增原config及保全哈希表，但prepare自动加入的是当前policy/assessment，历史发现仅自动纳入旧report，不会递归投影旧许可认证来源。保全表8项只有原config、plan、report可读且SHA匹配；原owner-policy、assessment及a122 request/receipt/permit五项未进入冻结索引。a122 snapshot/prior/capture-source/raw-final/native-rollout亦未投影，因此无法独立核验原parent/model、真实final及完成事件、repair-only permit和原批准稳定合同的字节关系。"},{"key":"beca4a8e3f4ff92339ce6f9850a793cb193d004bd722df8a3b6873d03aedcf69","id":"G7-residual","severity":"important","obligation":"implementation","root":"recovery path send identity backfill missing"},{"key":"c3158efbacc9d74b929ac9afe74a2d5863d1a66e26fdaecd6660450eaa9ca5dc","id":"PLAN-NATIVE-BUNDLE-COMPATIBILITY-1","severity":"important","obligation":"plan","root":"V11 已解决原先不重取执行却更新 bundle 的主要冲突，但仍有两个直接可执行缺口。实际 BUNDLE_FILES 和 review-bundle.json 均没有 test_native_review.py，方案却称其为 bundle member，并要求刷新测试 hash。另未明确新工具 suite/PFP 如何进入原 22-source manifest 的认证链、如何登记新的动态证据，以及如何避免改动已批准的稳定 config/extra 合同。"},{"key":"c6e02cf9e08dd6220095d7a745d840e4bbc1d0394afb40f6d6e2202cd6cc379f","id":"CONTROL-STOP-AUTHORITY-1","severity":"must","obligation":"plan","root":"首审指出第二停止版本与ExecutionScope同锁接纳权威脱节。v2已取消第二权威，固定StopVersionNow、StopActive(true)、请求原expectedStopVersion与JobDescriptor.ExpectedStopVersion的完整传递，最终比较和接纳仍共用Sync。此处