ryCreationInterrupted_ReopenPreservesAppliedOwnership。","OwnedDirectoryGetsForeignChild_RollbackPreservesForeignContentAndBlocks。","ExistingEmptyDirectoryIdentity_IsPreserved。","BeginOnThreadA_ContinueAndDisposeOnThreadB_RootLeaseReleasesExactlyOnce。","OwnerThreadFailure_AbandonedRecoveryUsesPersistentBinding。","DisposeDuringCallback_CrossThread_DoesNotReleaseRootAuthorityEarly。","突变目录归属/成员检查及 mutex 所有者释放调度；验证危险行为断言和 P/F/P。"]},"source":"_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/native-recovery-20261001/native/requests/ed9cc73dd6b24af0a1067bb5ec536eaa/report.json"}]

